# PRIVATE LAYER. Each team's corpus (free-canon distillates and book-to-skill
# ingests, derivative of licensed sources), its ledger (a clone of the team's
# own private ledger repo) and its books/ guard stay on this disk only. Never
# `git add` them; book-derived text never lands in a tracked file or an issue.
# `bin/canary-check.sh` proves these rules hold; run it before every push.
# 2026-10-08: Devcraft's corpus/, ledger/ and books/ join under the same rules.
/*/corpus/
/*/ledger/
/*/books/
*.epub

# Caches and local files
.DS_Store
.impeccable/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.env
.claude/settings.local.json
